{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>and your herds and your flocks multiply, and silver and gold</b> — silver and gold are juxtaposed to flocks to tell you: one who wishes to become wealthy should engage in small cattle. Nevertheless, ירבין is written defective, without vav, to tell you that if he grazes in others' fields, his assets collapse."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:12.588950538Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}